    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Driven by ever increasing inequalities, the rift between the American elite and the everyday American citizen is drastically widening. The dissatisfaction of the American people is beginning to show in many facets of American society, from the Occupy Wall Street movement to the frayed electorates of the 2016 presidential elections. In order to bring the voice of the everyday American back into financial and public policy, social media should be explored as a platform to create and expand grassroots movements.",
